# REST Client examples. Set baseUrl/token in your client's local environment.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = REPLACE_WITH_DRIVE_ADMIN_TOKEN

### Integration status
GET {{baseUrl}}/integrations/drive/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Latest 100 document records
GET {{baseUrl}}/integrations/drive/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Explicitly retry a failed or interrupted task after inspecting its effects
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/drive/documents/REPLACE_WITH_FILE_ID/retry
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Google alone sends the webhook requests. They use the generated channel
# secret and resource ID, not the admin token. Do not fabricate file events:
# the changes cursor, not the webhook payload, identifies changed documents.
